{"id": "media.dup-scan", "name": "STRM 重复扫描", "version": "1.2.0", "sdkVersion": "2", "entry": "plugin.py:Plugin", "description": "在作品目录内扫描重复 STRM，按 MediaTidy 评分规则与多版本槽位识别应保留/应删除版本。本地根（strm）走本地快路径 os.walk 遍历，绕过宿主逐文件审计（50w+ 库秒级）；云盘根走宿主 files.scan 异步任务。删除走 files.batch/files.delete，本地条目按 destination{rootId,path} 定位，附带 .nfo/-mediainfo.json 一并定位删除。", "author": "keronby", "permissions": ["files.read", "files.delete", "files.write", "storage", "rules.read", "tasks.read", "tasks.wait"], "configSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"readStrmContent": {"type": "boolean"}, "ruleId": {"type": "string"}, "scanSource": {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}, "rootId": {"type": "string"}}}, "toolSource": {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}, "rootId": {"type": "string"}}}}}, "actions": [{"id": "save-config", "label": "保存评分配置", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"readStrmContent": {"type": "boolean"}, "ruleId": {"type": "string"}, "scanSource": {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}, "rootId": {"type": "string"}}}, "toolSource": {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}, "rootId": {"type": "string"}}}}}, "outputSchema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}}, {"id": "dup-scan", "label": "开始查重（异步扫描）", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"readStrmContent": {"type": "boolean"}, "ruleId": {"type": "string"}, "source": {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}, "rootId": {"type": "string"}}}}}, "outputSchema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}}, {"id": "dup-scan-collect", "label": "查重结果收集（内部续接）", "kind": "continuation", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"runId": {"type": "string"}}}, "outputSchema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}}, {"id": "batch-wash", "label": "批量洗版删除", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"selections": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}}}, "outputSchem